<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Accessible via the Metro Blue Line, Southern Arlington also has many neighborhoods that attract a variety of people living in areas such as Crystal City or Pentagon City. Housing tends to be of the high-rise and apartment variety, although more residential properties do exist. Features of this area include the Pentagon, Pentagon City Shopping Center, and the Crystal City Shops. There are also a great deal of chain retail outlets available in the immediate area as well for grocery, home improvement, and other lifestyle needs.)
/E (Accessible via the Metro Blue Line, Southern Arlington also has many neighborhoods that attract a variety of people living in areas such as Crystal City or Pentagon City. Housing tends to be of the high-rise and apartment variety, although more residential properties do exist. Features of this area include the Pentagon, Pentagon City Shopping Center, and the Crystal City Shops. There are also a great deal of chain retail outlets available in the immediate area as well for grocery, home improvement, and other lifestyle needs.)
